WEBVTT

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.420
Wow!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.590
It looks like a castle!

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:10.120
Big company, big building, huh?

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:17.120
Oh, so 346 is short for "beautiful castle"!

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.020
My time has come!

00:01:58.060 --> 00:01:59.860
So the inside's like a castle too?

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.550
It's a bit overwhelming.

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:03.340
Yeah.

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:06.580
You don't see chandeliers much these days!

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:07.560
Yeah!

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.500
Oh, good morning!

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:13.620
I'm Honda Mio, a new idol!

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:15.170
I'll be part of this agency from today!

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:17.020
Oh, good morning.

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:18.340
Do you know her?

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:18.340
Good morning!

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:19.580
...No...

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:20.300
I'm Honda Mio!

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:23.240
Yes. We've been expecting you.

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.350
Please sign the visitor registry.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:27.470
Oh, okay.

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:33.360
Please wait in the Cinderella Project Room
on the thirtieth floor of the annex.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.860
Is <i>all</i> of this 346 Pro?

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.410
It's gotta be!

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:46.700
Papa told me that it's a huge company
that even produces its own films!

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:52.140
Which floor?

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:53.400
...Um...

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:54.760
Thirty.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:57.090
Ah! Wait up!

00:02:58.210 --> 00:02:59.580
Sorry about that.

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:02.000
No, no, it's fine!

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:04.140
...Ow...

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:04.680
Which floor?

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.970
Oh, twenty-two, please!

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:16.360
This must be it.

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:19.920
I wonder if any others are here.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.130
Ah. Ah.

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:24.530
Pleased to meet you.

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.410
...Excuse us...

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:33.500
Wow, what a view!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.460
...But no one's here...

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:40.570
Wow, this place looks so cool!

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:42.240
You're from the elevator!

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:44.970
Good morning.

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:47.660
Good morning.

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:50.390
Allow me to introduce you.

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:53.290
This is the first member I mentioned
...several days ago, Shimamura U—

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:54.230
Uzuki!

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.090
Um... Yes.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:58.280
And you're Shibuya Rin?

00:03:58.280 --> 00:03:59.570
...Yeah, I am...

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:04.630
What?

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:07.480
Rough and unsociable,
...but emitting a natural aura...

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:09.330
You've got potential!

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:10.920
...Uh...

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:15.620
This is the final member
of the project, Honda Mio.

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:17.290
The final member!

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:20.710
Honda Mio! High school first-year!

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:21.670
Nice to meet you!

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:23.630
Nice to meet you!

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:23.630
Same here.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:28.260
Unfortunately, Mio failed the first audition,

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:31.770
but was able to pass the
repeat audition to fill the last spot.

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:34.620
She's a very lucky girl.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:39.780
Well, it looks like the
god of idols has his eye on me!

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.160
By the way, by the way!

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:47.580
Was the reason I passed because
I'm a star athlete and idol of my school?!

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:48.450
Was it?

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:50.450
Your smile.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:53.710
I see. My smile.

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:59.660
Please fill these out by tomorrow.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:00.540
Will do.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:01.960
...Um...

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:04.200
I don't think we've met.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.010
Oh.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.260
I'm sorry for the late introduction.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:09.750
My name is Senkawa Chihiro.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:13.660
I'll be support staff for this project.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:15.180
It's a pleasure to meet you all.

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:18.020
Pleased to meet you.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:21.360
...It's not much, but to celebrate...

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:27.860
Energy drinks?

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.420
Do your best!

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:30.390
Thank you very much!

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.450
We will!

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:36.470
What grades are you guys in?

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:37.560
First-year, high school.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.830
Wow! Same here!

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:41.920
High school second-year this year.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.900
What? Really?

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.430
I thought you were in middle school.

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:47.130
I thought you were a first-year.

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:49.050
Wh-What?!

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.920
But it looks like you're a year older.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.180
You can show me the ropes.

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:59.450
R-Right! I'll do my best!

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:00.350
Yeah!

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:01.340
Show 'em to me too!

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:02.890
I'll do my best!

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:05.690
Look at you, acting the part already.

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:07.690
I'm the oldest!

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:09.820
Producer.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:13.480
Aren't there other members?

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:15.850
Yeah, yeah! What are they like?

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:16.910
Yeah, yeah!

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:21.020
You will be meeting
the other members later.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:23.170
...But before that, I'd like you to...

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:29.720
The first thing we do
as pros is practice, huh?

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.380
Tough stuff.

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:33.420
Practice is important!

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:36.410
Getting better is always a good thing.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:38.230
Let's do our best!

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:39.940
You're right.

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:41.190
Whoa!

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:43.440
...and I suddenly felt light and breezy!...

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:46.190
Thanks to talkin' about glasses, maybe?

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.380
I think it may have been!

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:51.920
Let's go light and breezy, girls!

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:52.440
Did you see them?!

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:54.490
Yeah! That was Blue Napoleon!

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:56.760
Oh man, and on our first day!
Talk about lucky!

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.010
They were almost sparkling!

00:06:58.010 --> 00:06:59.320
Oh my god, oh my god!

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:01.140
You think we might see Kaede?!

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:01.960
...Oh my...

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:04.550
Oh my god, I'm so pumped right now!

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:06.120
Huh? Rin?

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:07.450
R-Right.

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:15.470
Is this your first time dancing, Rin?

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.160
Yeah.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.220
What about you, Honda?

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:19.910
Just Mio's fine.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:22.270
Okay. Mio.

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:26.150
I danced a bit with my friends,

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:28.530
but this'll be my first time taking lessons.

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.230
I see.

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:32.860
I went to an art school,

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:35.270
so if you have any questions,
feel free to ask me!

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.440
Whoa, we've got a master!

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:42.490
I'll be your dance instructor.

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:44.210
It's a pleasure to meet you!

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:47.290
For now, just try keeping up with me.

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:49.250
All right! And step!

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:51.110
One, two, three, four,

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:52.710
five, six, seven, eight!

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:54.360
One, two, three, four,

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:55.720
five, six, seven, eight!

00:07:56.050 --> 00:07:57.720
One, two, three, four,

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.260
five, six, seven, eight!

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:00.980
One, two, three, four,

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:01.810
and turn!

00:08:06.890 --> 00:08:09.580
Sorry I lied. I'm actually really bad.

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:11.580
...I could do it the other day...

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:13.740
Dancing is hard.

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:14.820
...Yeah...

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:19.800
But exercise feels great.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:20.540
Yeah.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:27.460
I'm feeling energized!

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:33.710
They have a spa here.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.590
A spa?

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:41.240
We didn't leave the building, right?

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.640
Think we can use it?

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:45.020
I dunno.

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:48.540
Wanna go in?

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.360
...Wait, Mio...

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:55.070
"Secluded Hot Springs Special"?
More like "Mountain Climbing 101"!

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:57.290
Sounds like it was rough.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.560
We nearly got stranded up there.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:01.450
Well, you have the whole spa to relax today.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:04.200
Oh.

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:05.660
Hm?

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:07.210
Do you have an appointment?

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.180
...N-No...

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:12.000
Excuse us!

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:13.670
Ow!

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:14.470
Did you see that?!

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:16.810
That was Kawashima Mizuki, right?!

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:19.390
Yeah! She was beautiful!

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:22.940
Man, I've never even heard
of a company with a spa!

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:24.680
Me neither!

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:28.090
Hey, hey! Wanna explore?

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:28.940
Explore?

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:30.820
This building's huge!

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:32.740
There's gotta be a ton of stuff to see!

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:33.580
Let's go!

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:36.980
Wasn't Natsuki's guitar
playing just awesome, Shimamu?

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:39.420
Yeah! It was wonderful!

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:41.320
Huh? Shimamu?

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:44.180
I wish I could play like her!

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:46.310
You play the guitar?

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:48.000
No, not a pluck.

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:51.730
Look! They're doing an interview!

00:10:52.090 --> 00:10:53.230
You're right.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:54.710
Um, yes.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:57.640
I always get nervous before a concert.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:02.660
Sometimes it's hard to sleep,
so I hug my teddy bear until I can.

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:06.040
You can be <i>so</i> childish sometimes.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.650
It's Kohinata Miho and Kobayakawa Sae!

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:12.150
Are they idols too?

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:13.430
You bet!

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:13.430
Of course!

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:15.290
It's like everyone's an idol or something.

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:17.130
Welcome!

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:20.460
Welcome to the Mishiro Cafe.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:21.550
Here's our menu.

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:24.100
Is this a maid cafe?

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:26.260
I-I'm not sure.

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:31.160
I'm working here today for a few "reasons".

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:32.940
But my true identity?

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:33.900
Ker-twang!

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:37.470
Usamin Power! Märchen Change!

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:40.040
I've come from the Planet Usamin!

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.420
The all-singing, all-dancing,
voice-actress idol,

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:45.990
Usamin, a.k.a., Abe Nana!

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:47.030
Tehe!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.800
Good work today!

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:54.830
Good work today.

00:11:58.340 --> 00:11:59.590
Good morning.

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:01.820
Good morning.

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:07.600
Producer!

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:10.680
Hey, hey!

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:13.590
Do you know Takagaki Kaede or something?

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:14.390
Yes.

00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:16.520
Wow!

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:16.520
Amazing!

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:19.670
Are you, like, actually super big-time?

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.400
We work for the same agency.

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:24.630
More importantly, you're late.

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:25.700
Oh.

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:27.370
Sorry.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:30.510
We were exploring the building
and lost track of time.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.610
Time is critical.

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:35.290
Please try to be punctual from now on.

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.370
...We will...

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:39.370
Now then, come with me.

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:41.610
I'll introduce you to the other members.

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:42.490
Woo-hoo!

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.760
Okay!

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:48.760
And you will also have
your first job as idols.

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:50.140
Huh?

00:12:52.060 --> 00:12:53.100
I'm seeing some shadows.

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:54.470
Move that light a bit.

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:55.140
Got it.

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:56.600
Could I get some more light from above?

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:56.060
Wow!

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:57.480
Amazing!

00:12:57.030 --> 00:13:00.330
Yeah... Should we bring in some more lights?

00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:59.350
It's a real studio!

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:01.060
It's beautiful!

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:00.820
Please do.

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:03.530
And if I could get some from over there, that'd be great.

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:05.420
You'll be having your first
official headshots taken today.

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:04.710
...Sure...

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:06.550
But that might be in the frame there.

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:06.550
Pro headshots?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:10.650
If it works, could you do it, please?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:08.410
In this studio?

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:10.820
No, in this one.

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:11.880
Yeah, hang on.

00:13:10.820 --> 00:13:14.160
The other members are already in the shoot.

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:13.000
Great. Thanks.

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:17.710
Meow!

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:25.340
Da.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.470
Check break!

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:30.090
Wha's this? Wha's this?

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:31.970
Oh, the last members?

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:34.310
Hey, hey!

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:38.150
Are you girls part of the
Cinderella Project too?

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:38.940
Yes.

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:39.740
You bet!

00:13:39.740 --> 00:13:40.780
Yay!

00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:41.690
Awesome!

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:43.920
I'm Akagi Miria!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:47.110
Now we're all here! This is great!

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:48.550
Hey-o!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:50.840
I'm Jougasaki Rika!

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:52.460
I'm in seventh grade!

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:53.950
I hope we can be friends!

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:55.260
Sure!

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:55.260
Totally!

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:58.280
Weren't you in that tree earlier?

00:13:58.280 --> 00:14:00.660
Oh, you waved to me!

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:03.590
You shouldn't be climbing trees?
What if you break someowthing?

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:04.840
Meow?

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.870
Maekawa Miku's the nameow.

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:08.600
Nice to meowt you!

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:10.720
What kind of quirks are you guys doing?

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:12.020
...Um...

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:13.190
Quirks, huh?

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:13.190
Meow?

00:14:13.190 --> 00:14:14.890
Yoo-hi!

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:17.100
I'm Kirari!

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:18.980
Nice'a mee'cha, everybo'y!

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:20.850
...Same here...

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.030
I'm Nitta Minami.

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:24.730
Pleased to meet you.

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:27.190
Pleased to meet you too.

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:30.840
I guess I'm a little bit older
than everyone else here.

00:14:31.960 --> 00:14:34.240
Menya zovut Anastasia.

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:35.370
Huh?

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:36.730
...Um...

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.660
You can call me Anya.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:43.080
Nice to meet you. I'm Mimura Kanako.

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:46.970
I made these cookies myself.

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:48.550
Feel free to help yourself.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:50.200
Tada Riina.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.590
I wanna be a rockin' cool idol.

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:53.480
Wow!

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:55.080
So cool!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.040
...Um...

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:00.910
I-I'm Ogata Chieri.

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:02.500
...Um...

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:04.440
Pleased to meet you.

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:10.780
My name is Kanzaki Ranko.

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:16.240
By the blood contract, let us project
our souls' resonance upon this plane.

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:19.950
The feast begins.

00:15:20.490 --> 00:15:21.590
...Souls'... um...

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:23.820
What?

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:25.130
I dunno.

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:27.420
I think we're missing someone.

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:28.710
Hm?

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:31.340
La, la, la!

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:33.180
Foun's me an Anzu!

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:37.930
Futaba Anzu.

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:40.930
Nice to meet you.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.060
"You work, you lose"?

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:45.520
Oh.

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:48.190
I'm Shimamura Uzuki.

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:49.820
Um... I'll do my best!

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.880
Shibuya Rin.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:52.780
Nice to meet you.

00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:55.420
Honda Mio! High school first-year!

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:56.910
Call me Mio!

00:15:57.690 --> 00:16:01.060
These are the 14 members
of the Cinderella Project.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:03.160
...Does that mean we're finally...

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:04.380
Yes.

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:07.670
The Cinderella Project
officially begins now.

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:12.760
Happy, happy!

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:14.160
Awesome.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.870
You pumped too?

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:17.910
Yes!

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:19.460
I'll do my best!

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:20.510
Rin?

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:22.930
Yeah.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.020
Huh?

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.360
Sounds like fun in here.

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:29.390
We having a party?

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.820
Top high school model, Jougasaki Mika?!

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:35.840
That's me!

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:39.340
I think I saw her in a magazine.

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:40.940
Sis!

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:41.690
Huh?

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:42.860
"Sis"?

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:44.940
...Jougasaki...

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:45.670
Ah!

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:48.220
Hey, hey, what's this costume for?

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:50.210
The pamphlet for my next concert.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.420
I'm Honda Mio!

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:54.650
I'm going to be an idol starting today!

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:57.690
Oh, you guys doing headshots, then?

00:16:57.690 --> 00:16:58.590
Yes!

00:16:58.590 --> 00:16:59.720
Sounds like fun.

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:02.570
I'm in a different section,
but I hope we can work together sometime.

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:04.440
So do we!

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:07.340
Why don't you just transfer to ours?

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:11.320
Yeah, who knows what trouble
you'll make without me around?

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:13.210
Oh, come on!

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:16.680
Well, have fun with those headshots.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:17.820
Thank you!

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:28.470
...Wow...

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:30.270
She's amazing.

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:34.840
Shimamura, make up's ready for you.

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:35.970
O-Okay!

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:38.970
Yes, yes! Just like that! Now smile!

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:53.720
Face this way, please!

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:10.710
Shimamura, you're up.

00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:12.590
O-Okay!

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.610
A bit stiff. Smile!

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:23.020
Eyes into the camera!

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:25.740
And whoops!

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:27.310
Natural, please.

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:30.310
What do you think?

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.350
Another set, please.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:34.570
You got it.

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:35.930
Take five!

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:37.320
Okay!

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:38.410
This outfit's so cute!

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:39.570
Indeed.

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:42.170
I hope my shots came out okay.

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:44.600
You were cute out there, Chieri.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:45.790
Really?

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:49.770
We were totally stiff out there.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:50.680
Yeah.

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:53.630
...But it's just so nerve-racking...

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.260
Acting natural is hard.

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:00.280
Oh, I see.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:01.050
You got it.

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:05.080
We'll be doing all three of you at once.

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:06.810
Just play around like you normally do.

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:08.780
O-Okay!

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:10.810
What's normal like?

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:12.380
Huh?

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:15.520
Just do whatever you do!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.040
...Um...

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:22.140
...Well, then I guess...

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.110
Shimamu! Pass!

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:24.200
...Ow...

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:25.570
Whoops.

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:27.700
Shimamu?

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:29.950
Shiburin! Pass! Pass!

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:31.910
Shiburin?

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:33.540
Well, whatever.

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:36.710
Shimamu, toss!

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:38.890
Shiburin, spike!

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:43.430
Nice one!

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:51.100
Very nice! That smile!

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:55.600
Well, I <i>did</i> pass 'cause of my smile!

00:19:58.140 --> 00:19:59.430
I did too!

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:01.740
I passed because of my smile!

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:05.950
That's all he ever says.

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:07.910
Huh?

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:15.710
So it's the same for all of us!

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:19.610
All right! Let's go!

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:23.130
Pretty good for their first time.

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:23.130
Come on, Shiburin, that one was yours!

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:24.410
Sorry.

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:26.070
All right! Individual shots now!

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:27.020
Okay!

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:30.510
Hey, is their schedule set yet?

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:35.310
No.

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:44.790
All right, that's a wrap!

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:46.740
Hey, let's get a group shot!

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.150
Yeah!

00:20:48.150 --> 00:20:49.690
Producer!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.260
Why don't you join us?

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:53.660
Yeah, come on!

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:55.670
No.

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:56.990
You girls go ahead.

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:02.080
You ready? Smile!

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:09.850
What?!

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:12.390
You want us to be in your concert?

00:21:12.390 --> 00:21:13.670
Yeah!

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:17.810
I was looking for girls just like them
to be backup dancers!

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:21.720
Mika's producer has
given her the green light.

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:22.820
Should we accept the offer?

00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:25.660
...Personally, I—

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.120
Why not?

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:33.370
They'll be on stage
themselves sooner or later.

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:37.000
It might be a good start for them.

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:38.570
Who's that?

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:41.090
...I've seen him before...

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:44.540
Hear that? The Chief likes the idea!

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:45.510
The Chief?!

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:52.060
Could you bring me
the concert plans, then?

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:53.970
Yes. Right away.

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:57.020
Is that an okay?

00:21:57.020 --> 00:21:57.780
Yes.

00:21:57.780 --> 00:21:59.110
Awesome!

00:21:59.110 --> 00:22:00.850
Let's make this concert fun!

00:22:01.910 --> 00:22:03.240
Y-Yes!

00:22:03.240 --> 00:22:04.820
I'm looking forward to working with you!

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:07.240
I want in too!

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:08.870
Maybe next time.

00:22:08.870 --> 00:22:11.070
What? Why not?!

00:22:11.070 --> 00:22:13.910
I can do it! I can do it!

00:22:11.070 --> 00:22:13.910
I wanna get on stage sometimeow too!

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:15.790
...Living off royalties...

00:22:16.140 --> 00:22:17.620
A concert, huh?

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:19.830
I hope I get to be in one someday.

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:22.860
...I-I...

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:23.670
Ah!

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:32.440
Shouldn't we think it over first?

00:22:32.440 --> 00:22:34.060
Don't worry, don't worry!

00:22:34.060 --> 00:22:36.140
I always pull through
when it's the real deal!

00:22:36.140 --> 00:22:38.440
I've got a feeling we'll be totally fine!

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:39.390
Really?

00:22:39.740 --> 00:22:41.420
A concert, huh?

00:22:41.420 --> 00:22:42.990
It's going to be so fun!
